Comparison

# How each app compares

Thinking about another tool? Each app sets itself side by side with the tools it answers, including where each one is the better pick. Pick the app.

- [livediagram Diagram and draw together. See How livediagram Compares](https://www.livediagram.app/alternatives)
- [liveplanner Plan the work together. See How liveplanner Compares](https://www.liveplanner.app/alternatives)
- [livedocuments Write and present together. See How livedocuments Compares](https://www.livedocuments.app/alternatives)
- [livedesign Design logos, wireframes and photos together. See How livedesign Compares](https://www.livedesign.app/alternatives)
- [livehuddle Meet up in shared Spaces. See How livehuddle Compares](https://www.livehuddle.app/alternatives)
- [liveknowledge A team knowledgebase, for people and for AI. See How liveknowledge Compares](https://www.liveknowledge.app/alternatives)
